  "description": {
   "en": "Ametani Kantarou, a salesman at the publishing company Kicchousha, is a handsome glasses-wearing man with a great work ethic. He performs his duties quickly and is trusted by those around him, but he has a secret that he does not reveal to anyone. That is, he skips work to go on sweet-tooth tours! Ametani Kantarou is out on the road today to enjoy the world of sweet truancy."
